          "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
          "text": "<h3><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Your sports medicine education partner</span></h3>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">At Stryker, we strive to deliver world class education and experiences that allow healthcare professionals like you to safely and effectively use our products. We accomplish this with a diverse mix of programs to fit a variety of needs. Our extensive medical education and training will help advance your product and procedural knowledge and skills to help drive better patient outcomes.</span></p>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Mon Nov 04 2024 20:38:32 GMT+0000",
